; Test: Defeaters
; Coverage: defeater blocking a defeasible conclusion
; Defeaters prevent conclusions but do NOT prove the negation

; Basic defeater: bird normally flies, but wounded blocks flying
(given bird)
(given wounded)
(normally r1 bird flies)
(except d1 wounded (not flies))

; Defeater does NOT prove ~flies, it only blocks +d flies
; EXPECT: +D bird
; EXPECT: +d bird
; EXPECT: +D wounded
; EXPECT: +d wounded
; EXPECT: -d flies
; EXPECT: -d ~flies
